ultOpen` | `boolean` | Whether the full list is open. Leave `open` out to let the row toggle it. |"],[243,"| Name                   | Type      | Description                                                              |\n| ---------------------- | --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `open` / `defaultOpen` | `boolean` | Whether the trace is open. Leave `open` out to let the header toggle it. |"],[39,"| Name                  | Type       | Description                            |\n| --------------------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `onRemove` / `remove` | `callback` | Shows a remove button after the label. |"],[146,"| Name                  | Type       | Description           |\n| --------------------- | ---------- | --------------------- |\n| `onAction` / `action` | `callback` | Called by the button. |"],[161,"| Name                | Type       | Description                                                                                                          |\n| ------------------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `onRetry` / `retry` | `callback` | Called by a failed step's Retry button with the job's and the step's index. Without it, failed steps show no button. |"],[256,"| Name                | Type     | Description                                                   |\n| ------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `toast.description` | `string` | The quieter line under the title. Crossfades when it changes. |"],[242,"| Name               | Type      | Description                                      |\n| ------------------ | --------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `collapseWhenDone` | `boolean` | Folds the trace away a moment after it finishes. |"],[91,"| Name              | Type       | Description                    |\n| ----------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `onUndo` / `undo` | `callback` | Called by Undo once compacted. |"],[188,"| Name             | Type                       | Description                                        |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `onPeriodChange` | `(period: number) => void` | Called with the new index when the switch changes. |"],[173,"| Name            | Type                      | Description                                     |\n| --------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `onValueChange` | `(value: string) => void` | Fires with the new value when the pick changes. |"],[69,"| Name            | Type      | Description                                                           |\n| --------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `busy` / `done` | `boolean` | Drive the busy or done face yourself. Clicks are ignored while shown. |"],[187,"| Name            | Type     | Description                                                |\n| --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `defaultPeriod` | `number` | The period shown first when uncontrolled. Defaults to `0`. |"],[257,"| Name           | Type                                                           | Description                                           |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `toast.action` | `{ label; onClick; variant?: ghost \\| primary \\| ink; busy? }` | A button before the close button, like Undo or Retry. |"],[217,"| Name           | Type       | Description                                  |\n| -------------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `on