ption                                             |\n| ----------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `valueText` | `string` | The line under the title. Defaults to \"Step 3 of 5, …\". |"],[253,"| Name       | Type               | Description                                                                           |\n| ---------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `toast.id` | `string \\| number` | A new id slides a new toast in and the old one away. Keep it to change text in place. |"],[270,"| Name       | Type             | Description                                     |\n| ---------- | ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `openCard` | `string \\| null` | Shows this person's card by key, as if hovered. |"],[285,"| Name       | Type     | Description                                                                        |\n| ---------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `selected` | `string` | The id of the open span, whose details show under the waterfall. null closes them. |"],[228,"| Name       | Type     | Description                                                               |\n| ---------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `interval` | `number` | Milliseconds each line shows for when they take turns. `2600` by default. |"],[203,"| Name       | Type     | Description                                                       |\n| ---------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `progress` | `number` | 0 to 100, drawn as a track along the bottom of the `bar` variant. |"],[225,"| Name      | Type                                                  | Description                                  |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------