 The switch options. Each has a `label` and an optional `compare` line shown on hover. |"],[229,"| Name      | Type              | Description                                                                             |\n| --------- | ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `seconds` | `number \\| false` | Seconds shown at the end of the line. Counts by itself when left out; `false` hides it. |"],[269,"| Name      | Type             | Description                                                                          |\n| --------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `openTip` | `string \\| null` | Shows this tool's tip by key, as if hovered. Leave it out to let the pointer decide. |"],[204,"| Name      | Type          | Description                                                                      |\n| --------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `variant` | `pill \\| bar` | `pill` hugs its content; `bar` is taller and leaves room for the progress track. |"],[295,"| Name      | Type         | Description                                                                                                                          |\n| --------- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `queries` | `WebQuery[]` | The searches, in order. Each has a key, the query text, a status, a result count, a time, an optional rewritten flag, and its pages. |"],[7,"| Name      | Type       | Description                                                                                                                                                      |\n| --------- | ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `actions` | `Action[]` | The tool calls, newest at the end. Each has an `icon`, a `title`, an optional `detail`, a `state` of running or done, an optional `time`, and optional `output`. |"],[122,"| Name      | Type       | Description                                                                                 |\n| --------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `sources` | `Source[]` | The files and links it read. Each has a `label`, an optional `kind`, and an optional `tip`. |"],[9,"| Name      | Type      | Description                                                           |\n| --------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `running` | `boolean` | Shows a spinner in the header while true, and a green dot once false. |"],[238,"| Name      | Type      | Description                                                |\n| --------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `running` | `boolean` | Spins, counts seconds and keeps the trace open while true. |"],[117,"| Name      | Type      | Description                                           |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `running` | `boolean` | Shimmers the title and counts the seconds while true. |"],[73,"| Name      | Type      | Description                                        |\n| --------- | --------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `pressed` | `boolean` | For a toggle: whether it is on, as `aria-pressed`. |"],[72,"| Name      | Type      | Description                |\n| --------- | --------- | -------------------------- |\n| `success` | `boolean` | The done face turns green. |"],[158,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                                                             |\n| --------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `summary` | `string` | The line under \"All N jobs done\" once every job is done, like \"18.4s in all · 1 retry\". |"],[227,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                                                        |\n| --------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `current` | `number` | Index of the line to show. Leave it out to let the lines take turns by themselves. |"],[22,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                                                       |\n| --------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `seconds` | `number` | Seconds so far. Counts by itself while left out, and stops while waiting for you. |"],[213,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                                                     |\n| --------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `current` | `number` | Index of the step running now. `steps.length` or more means every step is done. |"],[55,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                                                  |\n| --------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `seconds` | `number` | Seconds to show as m:ss. Leave it out to let the clock count while browsing. |"],[118,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                                         |\n| --------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `seconds` | `number` | Seconds to show. Leave it out to let the trail count while it runs. |"],[239,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                                  |\n| --------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `seconds` | `number` | Seconds to show. Leave it out to let it count while running. |"],[241,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                                  |\n| --------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `summary` | `string` | The header once it is done. Defaults to the number of steps. |"],[85,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                          |\n| --------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `message` | `string` | A line under the legend. Crossfades when it changes. |"],[57,"| Name      | Type     | Description                                    |\n| --------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `summary` | `string` | Shown under the steps once every step is done. |"],[140,"| Name     | Type                                            | Description                               |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `status` | `idle \\| running \\| stopped \\| paused \\| spent` | running is blue, paused amber, spent red. |"],[202,"| Name     | Type                                     | Description                                               |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `action` | `{ label: string; onClick: () => void }` | A button at the end, for when the agent needs the person. |"],[214,"| Name     | Type                            | Description                                                   |\n| -------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `loader` | `radar \\| dots \\| ring \\| bars` | The loader glyph beside the running step. `radar` by default. |"],[265,"| Name     | Type              | Description                                                                                                      |\n| -------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `groups` | `TooltipTool[][]` | The toolbar's buttons, in groups with a line between. Each tool is `{ key, icon, label, tip?, kbd?, onClick? }`. |"],[266,"| Name     | Type              | Description                                                                                                      |\n| -------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `people` | `TooltipPerson[]` | Avatars at the end. Each is `{ key, initials, color, name, role, status, working? }`; hovering one shows a card. |"],[49,"| Name     | Type      | Description                                                       |\n| -------- | --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `search` | `boolean` | Marks `url` as a search, with a magnifier instead of the padlock. |"],[297,"| Name     | Type     | Description                                                                                                 |\n| -------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `answer` | `string` | The answer, with sources cited as numbers in brackets. Each number points at the page with that cite value. |"],[51,"| Name     | Type     | Description                                                                                 |\n| -------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cursor` | `object` | The agent's own pointer, in pixels from the page's top left. Hidden while you have control. |"],[284,"| Name     | Type     | Description                                                                                |\n| -------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `status` | `string` | Overrides the status line. Defaults to \"Running · 4 spans\", then \"Done · 7 spans, 1 slow\". |"],[10,"| Name     | Type     | Description                                                                         |\n| -------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `status` | `string` | The words beside the header mark. Defaults to \"Running step N\", then \"N steps, Xs\". |"],[84,"| Name     | Type     | Description                                                                    |\n| -------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `warnAt` | `number` | From this share of the limit (0 to 1) the ring turns orange. Defaults to 0.85. |"],[186,"| Name     | Type     | Description                                                           |\n| -------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `period` | `number` | The period on show, by index. Leave it out to let the switch pick it. |"],[157,"| Name     | Type     | Description                                                           |\n| -------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `status` | `string` | Overrides the status line. Defaults to \"1 of 4 done\" or \"All 4 done\". |"],[56,"| Name     | Type     | Description                                                          |\n| -------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `status` | `string` | The line under the title. Defaults to a status word, then the clock. |"],[137,"| Name     | Type     | Description                  |\n| -------- | -------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `budget` | `number` | The whole budget, like 2000. |"],[20,"| Name    | Type                                                             | Description                  |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `phase` | `thinking \\| searching \\| reading \\| waiting \\| writing \\| done` | Which phase the agent is in. |"],[199,"| Name    | Type                                                        | Description                                                                             |\n| ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `state` | `idle \\| thinking \\| reading \\| working \\| waiting \\| done` | Picks the glyph and colour. `thinking`, `reading` and `working` shimmer while they run. |"],[101,"| Name    | Type                                                      | Description                                  |\n| ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `state` | `indeterminate \\| running \\| paused \\| error \\| complete` | Colours the run and picks the control shown. |"],[212,"| Name    | Type                                 | Description                                                                           |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `steps` | `{ label: string; done?: string }[]` | The steps. `label` shows while running, `done` once finished (falls back to `label`). |"],[251,"| Name    | Type                | Description                            |\n| ------- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `toast` | `ToastData \\| null` | The toast to show, or `null` for none. |"],[184,"| Name    | Type              | Description                                                