, its `tokens`, an optional `color`, and optional `items` shown on hover. |"],[108,"| Name    | Type            | Description                                                |\n| ------- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `meter` | `ProgressMeter` | A meter under the run, with thresholds that warn in words. |"],[280,"| Name    | Type          | Description                                                            |\n| ------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `spans` | `TraceSpan[]` | The run's top spans, usually one root with everything nested under it. |"],[226,"| Name    | Type       | Description                                                                   |\n| ------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `steps` | `string[]` | The status lines. With more than one they take turns unless `current` is set. |"],[121,"| Name    | Type       | Description                      |\n| ------- | ---------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `notes` | `string[]` | The agent's notes, one per line. |"],[139,"| Name    | Type      | Description                                                      |\n| ------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `capOn` | `boolean` | Whether the cap is on. Leave it out to let the switch change it. |"],[23,"| Name    | Type     | Description                                                                                                   |\n| ------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `error` | `object` | A step that failed: the line turns red and says so, with Retry. Has `text`, optional `detail`, and `onRetry`. |"],[123,"| Name    | Type     | Description                                                                          